# A hosted round on the local platform, the host's side (alice, desktop):
# Hosted Play, Create room, wait for bob, Start round (the two AI seats fill
# the room), then steer by keys until the result the server script records.
# viewport 1280x720@1
until 900 =Hosted Play
frames 30
click =Hosted Play
until 300 =Create room
frames 10
click =Create room
until 600 =Start round
frames 10
save online-host-room
until 3000 2 in lobby
frames 20
save online-host-lobby
click =Start round
until 1200 Hosted round: claim territory
frames 60
save online-host-play
repeat 4000 until Result recorded by the StarHermit server
  key ArrowUp 1
  frames 12
  key ArrowLeft 1
  frames 12
  key ArrowDown 1
  frames 12
  key ArrowRight 1
  frames 12
end
frames 30
save online-host-results
expect Standings
